sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Médico / Enfermeiro
    participant B as Browser
    participant W as JSF Bean<br/>(MinhaAgendaBean)
    participant S as ArquivoService<br/>(EJB)
    participant G as StorageGuard
    participant R as StoragePathResolver
    participant O as S3ObjectStorage<br/>(AWS SDK v2)
    participant M as MinIO / S3
    participant D as ArquivoDAO
    participant P as PostgreSQL

    U->>B: Seleciona PDF + "Enviar anexo"
    B->>W: POST multipart/form-data
    W->>S: anexarEmConsulta(idConsulta, bytes, ct, filename, ...)
    S->>G: validar(filename, ct, size, head)
    Note over G: AX-01 MIME whitelist<br/>AX-02 tamanho<br/>AX-06 sanitize filename<br/>magic bytes batem com ct
    G-->>S: ok
    S->>R: buildLogicalPath(ANEXO_CONSULTA, idConsulta, filename)
    R-->>S: /anexos/consulta/{id}/yyyy/MM/{uuid}.pdf
    S->>O: put(pathLogico, stream, size, ct)
    O->>R: resolve(pathLogico)
    R-->>O: BucketBinding(bucket, key)
    O->>M: PutObject(bucket, key, body)
    M-->>O: 200 OK + etag
    O-->>S: StoragePutResult(path, size, ct, etag)
    S->>S: SHA-256 do payload
    S->>D: salvar(Arquivo)
    D->>P: INSERT INTO tb_arquivo
    P-->>D: id
    D-->>S: Arquivo persistido
    S-->>W: Arquivo
    W-->>B: ajax update + growl "Anexo enviado"
    B-->>U: lista atualizada com novo arquivo
